(14, 14, 'The AIRE Air Purifiers for Home Ultra Series 200 represents advanced engineering in clean air management. Built for demanding technical, commercial, and luxury residential environments, delivering certified particulate capture, ultra-quiet fluid dynamics, and intelligent automation.', 'PORTABLE AIR CARE', 'AIRE Air Purifiers for Home Ultra Series 200 | AIRE Advanced Clean Air Systems', 'Explore AIRE Air Purifiers for Home Ultra Series 200. Certified medical-grade H13/H14 HEPA filtration, smart IoT sensor array, and architectural performance.', 'aire, air-purifiers-for-home, air purifier, clean air, hepa filter, h13, h14', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'SPECIFICATIONS', 'Technical Specifications', 'Overview\r\nModel Number: SG500\r\nPower (W): 54-140W\r\nVoltage (V): 220\r\nAfter-sales Service Provided: Field maintenance and repair service\r\nWarranty: 2 years\r\nType: ELECTROSTATIC\r\nInstallation: Portable\r\nCertification: ce, RoHS, FCC\r\nApplication: Hotel, Commercial, Household, Household purifier and Commercial\r\nPower Source: Electric, Electrical\r\nProduct name: Home Fresh Air Machine SG500\r\nColor: White\r\nSize: 21.2*19.2*53 Inch\r\nWeight: 242.5 LB\r\nService: 2year\r\nPower supply: Electric\r\nPM2.5: 99%\r\nCoverage: 120~200 m2 (1292 ~ 2153 sqft)', 'product/14/specs-bg-1792633309.png', 'bi bi-shield-check', 'FILTRATION', '99.97%', NULL, '@ 0.3MM EFFICIENCY', 'bi bi-wind', 'VELOCITY', '4.2', 'L/sec', 'MAX AIRFLOW RATE', 'bi bi-battery-charging', 'ENDURANCE', '12', 'Hours', 'CONTINUOUS OPERATION', 'bi bi-box-seam', 'MASS', '185', 'Grams', 'TOTAL SYSTEM WEIGHT', 'FEATURES', 'Precision Engineered Details', 'Technology 1:Electrostatic precipitator The core component of the electrostatic dust remover, electrostatic dust collector, can be taken out at any time. The purification effect can be seen as 6000V high voltage electrostatic, and the current is only 1-3mA, which is smaller than the mobile phone current, safe and reliable, maintenance only needs cleaning and no consumables. It is convenient and economical to filter dust smaller than PM2.5.\r\nTechnology 2: Electrostatic sterilization Electrostatic tungsten wire releases high voltage static electricity of about 6000 V, killing bacteria, viruses and so on instantly, which can effectively reduce the probability of various air-borne diseases.\r\nTechnology 3: Filter formaldehyde (optional, need to be purchased separately)  Using pure coconut shell as the base material, after deep processing and three improvements, the pore structure is developed and the adsorption capacity is strong', 'product/14/feat-bg-1792633311.jpeg', 'bi bi-shield-lock', 'Medical-Grade Facial Seal', 'Hypoallergenic LSR silicone ensures a perfect, pressure-mapped seal for all-day comfort in high-stakes environments.', 'bi bi-lightbulb', 'Active Feedback Ring', 'Integrated LED halo provides real-time data on air quality and filter life at a glance, ensuring constant operational awareness.', 'bi bi-funnel', 'Advanced HEPA Filtration', 'Dual H13 Industrial filters capture 99.97% of particulates with micro-pleated geometry for maximum surface area efficiency.', 'Industrial Excellence, Personal Comfort', 'AIRE Air Purifiers for Home Ultra Series 200 is engineered to exceed safety standards in the most demanding environments, from high-tech labs to daily mobility.', 'TECHNOLOGY', 'The Physics of Pure Air', 'BROAD SQ260 — Advanced Air Purification & Fresh Air Technology\r\nThe BROAD SQ260 combines multi-stage air filtration, electrostatic air cleaning and fresh air ventilation to help deliver cleaner outdoor air indoors while exhausting stale indoor air.\r\n1. Three-Stage Air Filtration Technology\r\n	•	Stage 1 — Washable Coarse Filter: A 304 stainless-steel mesh filter designed to capture larger airborne particles, including dust, hair and other coarse contaminants.\r\n	•	Stage 2 — Electrostatic Air Cleaner: An electrostatic filtration stage designed to capture fine particles. Its metal collector is washable and reusable.\r\n	•	Stage 3 — H13 HEPA Filtration: A high-efficiency particulate filter designed to capture fine airborne particles, including PM2.5. The filter requires periodic replacement.\r\n2. Electrostatic Air Cleaning Technology\r\n	•	High-Voltage Electrostatic Technology: BROAD\'s supplied literature describes a patented electrostatic cleaning system operating at approximately 6,000 V.\r\n	•	Fine Particle Capture: Helps remove fine airborne particles from the airstream.\r\n	•	Antibacterial and Antiviral Performance: BROAD\'s literature reports up to 99.99% bacteria and virus removal under specified test conditions. Confirm this rating for the SQ260 before publishing.\r\n	•	Washable Metal Collector: The electrostatic collection component can be washed and reused, helping reduce disposable-filter consumption.\r\n	•	Low Airflow Resistance: Designed to clean air without relying exclusively on dense disposable filter media.\r\n3. High-Efficiency PM2.5 Filtration\r\n	•	Fine Particle Filtration: The combined filtration system is designed to reduce airborne dust and fine particulate matter.\r\n	•	Multi-Stage Protection: Coarse filtration, electrostatic cleaning and HEPA filtration work in sequence to target different particle sizes.\r\n	•	Cleaner Supply Air: Helps reduce the entry of outdoor particulate pollution into indoor spaces.\r\nPerformance note: The supplied BROAD material contains different filtration-efficiency claims, including 99.9% and 99.99%. Confirm the exact rated efficiency and test standard for the SQ260 before publishing a specific percentage.\r\n4. Heat Recovery Technology\r\n	•	Heat Recovery Ventilation: The product-range literature describes a heat-exchange system that transfers thermal energy between outgoing indoor air and incoming outdoor air.\r\n	•	Reduced Heating and Cooling Losses: Heat recovery can help reduce the energy required to condition incoming fresh air.\r\n	•	Nano-Polymer Heat Exchanger: BROAD\'s supplied material describes a washable nano-polymer energy-recovery core for relevant models in its range.\r\n	•	Condensation Management: Appropriate insulation and heat-exchanger design can help manage condensation risk.\r\nModel-specific confirmation: The supplied material mentions heat-recovery efficiency of up to 80% for the product range. Confirm that this rating and the stated heat-exchanger type apply specifically to the SQ260.\r\n5. Fresh Air Supply & Exhaust Ventilation\r\n	•	Continuous Outdoor Air Supply: Introduces fresh outdoor air into the indoor environment.\r\n	•	Stale Air Exhaust: Removes indoor air to help reduce the accumulation of CO₂, odours and indoor pollutants.\r\n	•	Supply-and-Exhaust Ventilation: Supply and exhaust airflow work together to improve indoor air exchange.\r\n	•	Indoor Air Quality Support: Helps dilute indoor-generated pollutants when correctly sized and installed.\r\n6. Formaldehyde & Indoor Pollutant Reduction\r\n	•	Pollutant Exhaust: Continuous air exchange helps remove formaldehyde and other indoor gaseous pollutants by exhausting contaminated indoor air.\r\n	•	Reported Experimental Result: The supplied promotional graphic reports a reduction in formaldehyde concentration from 0.32 ppm to 0.02 ppm in 35 minutes, with a maximum exhaust airflow of 170 m³/h.\r\n	•	Test Conditions Matter: Do not present these results as guaranteed SQ260 performance unless the test report confirms the model, room volume, measurement method and operating conditions.\r\n7. Washable Filters & Maintenance\r\n	•	304 Stainless-Steel Coarse Filter: Corrosion-resistant mesh designed for repeated washing.\r\n	•	Reusable Electrostatic Collector: Washable metal construction helps reduce consumable-filter waste.\r\n	•	Replaceable HEPA Filter: Provides a dedicated fine-particle filtration stage and requires replacement according to operating conditions and manufacturer guidance.\r\n	•	Practical Routine Maintenance: Washable components can help reduce recurring filter costs, although regular inspection and cleaning remain necessary.\r\n8. SQ260 Technical Specifications\r\nSpecification\r\nSQ260\r\nRated airflow\r\n260 m³/h\r\nRated external static pressure\r\n40 Pa\r\nNoise level\r\n39 dB(A)\r\nPower input\r\n112 W\r\nDimensions (as listed)\r\n530 × 260 × 1,100 mm\r\nNet weight\r\n37 kg\r\nSpecifications are transcribed from the supplied BROAD product document. Confirm dimensions, noise test conditions and electrical requirements against the current manufacturer\'s datasheet before publication.\r\nDesigned for Cleaner Indoor Air\r\nThe BROAD SQ260 brings together fresh air ventilation, multi-stage particle filtration and electrostatic air cleaning in one system. Its washable coarse and electrostatic filters, combined with a replaceable HEPA stage, are intended to support cleaner supply air and practical routine maintenance.\r\nRecommended applications: Homes, apartments, bedrooms, study rooms and other appropriately sized indoor spaces, subject to the manufacturer\'s approved application and airflow requirements.', 'product/14/tech-1792633311.jpeg', 'ACTIVE POSITIVE PRESSURE', 'Smart sensors detect inhalation resistance and automatically adjust fan velocity to ensure a constant supply of fresh air, regardless of respiratory demand.', 'Stage 1 — Washable Coarse Filter:', 'A 304 stainless-steel mesh filter designed to capture larger airborne particles, including dust, hair and other coarse contaminants.', 'PARTICULATE SENSING', 'Integrated laser-based sensors scan for PM2.5 concentrations every 500ms, providing hyper-responsive airflow modulation.', 'BIO-MECHANICAL FIT', 'The structural chassis is crafted from aerospace-grade polymers, achieving an industry-leading strength-to-weight ratio for ergonomic balance.', '2026-08-26 06:09:56', '2026-10-21 20:40:50'),
