(2108, 14, 'What makes BROAD\'s filtration technology superior to standard HEPA only systems in large projects?', 'BROAD utilizes a hybrid system combining proprietary Electrostatic Purification and high-efficiency filtration. The electrostatic field delivers a 99.99% sterilization rate by instantly destroying bacteria and viruses, while achieving a 99.9% PM2.5 filtration efficiency.\r\nUnlike standard HEPA filters that require frequent, costly replacements and cause high pressure drops, our electrostatic filters are washable and reusable, maintaining a 40-year design life. This drastically lowers the Total Cost.', 1, '2026-10-21 20:40:51', '2026-10-21 20:40:51'),
(2109, 14, 'Is this product suitable for high-intensity exercise and sports?', 'Yes. The active pressure balance system dynamically adjusts airflow to match your breathing rate, preventing CO2 buildup and keeping the interior cool during physical exertion.', 2, '2026-10-21 20:40:51', '2026-10-21 20:40:51'),
