(2811, 150, 'Does the device support Bluetooth and Smart App connectivity?', 'Yes, it connects to the AIRE app via Bluetooth 5.2 and Wi-Fi for real-time air quality monitoring, filter health tracking, and firmware updates.', 4, '2026-10-26 14:59:14', '2026-10-26 14:59:14'),
(2812, 150, 'What is the battery life of the active sensors and motor?', 'The internal lithium-ion battery provides up to 12 hours of continuous operation on a single charge. It supports fast charging via USB-C, reaching 80% in just 45 minutes.', 5, '2026-10-26 14:59:14', '2026-10-26 14:59:14'),
(3158, 1, 'Is FF100 an air purifier or a fresh-air ventilator?', 'FF100 is a wall-mounted fresh-air ventilation system with energy recovery and filtration. It is not simply a recirculating portable air purifier.', 1, '2026-11-01 10:24:09', '2026-11-01 10:24:09'),
(3159, 1, 'How much fresh air does FF100 provide?', 'The published rated fresh-air capacity is 100 m³/h, approximately 58.9 CFM.', 2, '2026-11-01 10:24:09', '2026-11-01 10:24:09'),
(3160, 1, 'Does FF100 mix recycled indoor air into the supply?', 'BROAD markets the system as 100% fresh air with no mixed recycled air', 3, '2026-11-01 10:24:09', '2026-11-01 10:24:09'),
(3161, 1, 'How often should the filters be serviced?', 'Clean the coarse filter every 1–3 months. Inspect the HEPA filter every 6–12 months and replace it sooner if airflow falls by approximately 30%.', 4, '2026-11-01 10:24:09', '2026-11-01 10:24:09'),
(3162, 1, 'What room size is recommended?', 'The current official product information recommends approximately 10–30 m².', 5, '2026-11-01 10:24:09', '2026-11-01 10:24:09'),
(3168, 36, 'How long do the HEPA H13 filters last?', 'Under normal conditions, filters should be replaced every 120-150 hours of active use. The integrated sensor will notify you via the LED ring and app when replacement is required.', 1, '2026-11-01 11:55:03', '2026-11-01 11:55:03'),
(3169, 36, 'Is this product suitable for high-intensity exercise and sports?', 'Yes. The active pressure balance system dynamically adjusts airflow to match your breathing rate, preventing CO2 buildup and keeping the interior cool during physical exertion.', 2, '2026-11-01 11:55:03', '2026-11-01 11:55:03'),
