(3218, 24, 'Which filter does the FB2 use?', 'Supplier information lists an H13 HEPA filter. Please check the product manual for compatible replacement filters and the recommended replacement interval.', 1, '2026-11-06 12:02:44', '2026-11-06 12:02:44'),
(3219, 24, 'How is the FB2 charged?', 'Supplier information lists a built-in rechargeable lithium battery and USB DC 5 V charging. Use the supplied or manufacturer-approved charging cable and follow the manual.', 2, '2026-11-06 12:02:44', '2026-11-06 12:02:44'),
(3220, 24, 'How long does the battery last?', 'Supplier feature copy states 8–12 hours, but actual runtime depends on fan speed, battery condition, and use. Confirm the model-specific test conditions before relying on this figure.', 3, '2026-11-06 12:02:44', '2026-11-06 12:02:44'),
(3221, 24, 'How often should the filter be replaced?', 'The supplier listing states 500 hours of filter use. Follow the current FB2 manual and replace the filter according to the specified interval and usage conditions.', 4, '2026-11-06 12:02:44', '2026-11-06 12:02:44'),
(3222, 24, 'Does the mask provide medical or infection protection?', 'Do not present the FB2 as medical PPE or as preventing infection unless the exact product has the relevant certification and model-specific test evidence. Follow the manufacturer’s instructions.', 5, '2026-11-06 12:02:44', '2026-11-06 12:02:44');
