(1, 1, 'Single Room Ductless Installation Wall Mounted Fresh Air Ventilator', 'BROAD FE6 Pro — Product Summary\r\nThe BROAD FE6 Pro is a compact, single-room, wall-mounted Energy Recovery Ventilator (ERV) designed to introduce filtered outdoor air while exhausting stale indoor air. Its heat-recovery system helps reduce the energy lost during ventilation, making it suitable for bedrooms, living rooms, home offices, and other small residential spaces.\r\n\r\nThe product is associated with fresh-air ventilation, particulate filtration, and indoor-air-quality improvement. Depending on the filter configuration, it may help reduce airborne dust and other particles. Claims concerning HEPA performance, VOC removal, bacteria and viruses, and heat-recovery efficiency should be verified against the manufacturer\'s current model-specific specifications.\r\nCategories\r\n- Room Size: 200–500 sq ft\r\n- Product Series: AIRPRO HEPA Series\r\n- Product Type: Single Room Wall-Mounted Fresh Air Machine\r\n- Ventilation: Fresh Air Unit — ERV Heat Recovery\r\n- Applications: Home & Residential Solutions; Small Rooms\r\n- Indoor Air Quality: Allergies & Dust; Asthma; Bacteria & Virus; Chemicals & VOCs; Mold &  Window Condensation; Pets & Odours; Smoke & Wildfire\r\n- Product Features: HEPA Filter; Heat Recovery; Fresh Air Unit', NULL, 'bi bi-cpu', 'Fresh-air concept', '100% fresh air; no mixed recycled air', 'bi bi-shield-check', 'Heat recovery', '60 % at Δt 45°F manufacturer claim', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-26 23:46:04', '2026-10-27 12:59:56'),
(4, 4, 'Intelligent Air Purification Designed for Modern Living', 'The AIRE Fresh Air Systems Ultra Series 803 delivers clinical-grade indoor air purification with ultra-low acoustic signature and smart environmental sensor integration, ensuring uninterrupted clean air for your entire environment.', '', 'bi bi-broadcast', 'ACTIVE SENSING & ADAPTATION', 'Hyper-responsive laser particulate monitoring adjusts purification levels in real time.', 'bi bi-tree', 'ZERO-OZONE CERTIFIED', 'Pure mechanical filtration without harmful emissions, ensuring safe continuous operation in residential spaces.', 'AP-FRES-123', 'FRESH AIR SYSTEMS', 'CERTIFIED HIGH EFFICIENCY', '2026-08-26 23:46:04', '2026-08-26 23:46:04'),
