(14, 14, 'Intelligent Fresh air System Heat Recovery Ventilation Unit', 'APP control 120-200m2 house flat apartment central control floor standing energy recovery units ventilation machine\r\nModel: SQ500 (Floor standing, Direct blow, Ductless)\r\nPower consumption: 243W\r\nAir volume: 500m3/h fresh air\r\nPerformance: 99.9% PM2.5 filtration efficiency; \r\n                        100% fresh air without mixing recycled air;\r\n                        80% ERV heat recovery efficiency;\r\nApplicable places:  120-200㎡ Room\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAdvantages:\r\n1. Bi-directional direct blow fresh air ventilation machine (ductless), 100% fresh & clean air without mixing recycled air, NO cross-contamination, lowering CO2 density in a closed room\r\n2. 3-stage filtration system, 99.9% PM2.5 filtration effect: Indoor air is 100 times cleaner than outdoor air\r\n3. Electrostatic cleaner continuously releases 6000V high voltage static electricity to kill bacteria and viruses: \r\n    Completely eliminate germs and avoid secondary pollution\r\n4. 80% heat recovery effect: Recover heat and cooling from exhaust air, saving Air conditioner operation cost\r\n5. Coarse filter and Electrostatic cleaner are metal material, washable: Long service life, no consumable\r\n6. H13 PTFE HEPA filter could be replaced in 1-2 years: Low consumable cost\r\n7. 40 years machine design life: Long service life', 'product/14/overview-1792636850.png', 'bi bi-broadcast', 'ACTIVE SENSING & ADAPTATION', 'Hyper-responsive laser particulate monitoring adjusts purification levels in real time.', 'bi bi-tree', 'ZERO-OZONE CERTIFIED', 'Pure mechanical filtration without harmful emissions, ensuring safe continuous operation in residential spaces.', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-26 23:46:04', '2026-10-21 20:40:51'),
