(24, 24, 'Intelligent Air Purification Designed for Modern Living', 'The BROAD FB2 AirPro Mask is a compact, rechargeable wearable air-purification device designed for personal use at home, at work, while commuting, and outdoors. It uses an H13 HEPA filter and a powered air-supply system. Review the verified technical specifications and usage instructions before use.', NULL, 'bi bi-wind', 'Active Air Supply', 'Supplier-stated airflow: 4 m³/h. Actual airflow may depend on fan mode and filter condition.', 'bi bi-battery-charging', 'Rechargeable & Portable', 'Built-in rechargeable lithium battery; USB DC 5 V charging is stated in the supplier feature copy.', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-26 23:46:04', '2026-11-01 10:28:04'),
